{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43486","headline":"晨光动翠华 · 无名氏","name":"晨光动翠华","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"早朝开紫殿，佳气逐清晨。\n北阙华旌在，东方曙景新。\n影连香雾合，光媚庆云频。\n鸟羽飘初定，龙文照转真。\n直疑冠佩入，长爱冕旒亲。\n摇动祥云里，朝朝映侍臣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无名氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43486.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43486","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}